      "text_copy3385842489417942": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">When did you start running?</span><br>\nI started about a year and a half ago. I got interested in ultramarathons and tried the Keys100 race in May of 2019—a 100-mile race from Key Largo to Key West. Ultimately, I failed after 72 miles. I was planning on doing the race again this year, but it was canceled because of COVID-19.<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">What made you decide to take on this challenge?</span><br>\nI heard about it on social media from an endurance athlete I follow. After finding out that the Keys100 was canceled and seeing the great cause of the Calendar Club, I figured it was the perfect opportunity.</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 08 2020 18:48:48 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true",
